WEBVTT

00:03:59.902 --> 00:04:03.072
Because when we allow people like me
to systemically be prevented

00:04:03.072 --> 00:04:05.741
from entering into
these competitive fields,

00:04:05.741 --> 00:04:09.328
we uphold the elitist
and exclusionary systems

00:04:09.370 --> 00:04:11.330
that allow so many children to be told

00:04:11.372 --> 00:04:14.083
that they're not worthy enough
to pursue their dreams.

00:04:14.750 --> 00:04:16.377
I wanted to change that.

00:04:16.419 --> 00:04:19.213
For many years, I had no clue how.

00:04:19.255 --> 00:04:23.134
But when the COVID pandemic hit
and our entire world went virtual,

00:04:23.175 --> 00:04:26.304
I saw an opportunity
to help others learn music online,

00:04:26.345 --> 00:04:29.015
regardless of who they were,
where they lived,

00:04:29.056 --> 00:04:30.433
or what they could afford.